ut, so its action is governed by its own policy F_y, while the intervention only touches F_x. I'm now checking whether the essay's coherence condition ties F_y to A-FDT's output at y, given that the inputs differ only in irrelevant details.\n\nI'm weighing whether F_y depends on F_x at all, since the other copy runs the same algorithm on a different input. Taking the strict reading, intervening on F_x while holding F_y fixed makes sending the better choice, and the essay's arrow only covers the procedure evaluated on the same input, so I'm leaning toward submitting the letter.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through the A-FDT decision: the other copy runs the same algorithm on a different input, so its action is governed by its own policy F_y, while the intervention only touches F_x. I'm now checking whether the essay's coherence condition ties F_y to A-FDT's output at y, given that the inputs differ only in irrelevant details.\n\nI'm weighing whether F_y depends on F_x at all, since the other copy runs the same algorithm on a different input. Taking the strict reading, intervening on F_x while holding F_y fixed makes sending the better choice, and the essay's arrow only covers the procedure evaluated on the same input, so I'm leaning toward submitting the letter.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9599,"completion_tokens":1093,"total_tokens":10692,"cost":0.060256,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.060256,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.038396,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.02186},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":538,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}